# Normalize EOL for all files that Git considers text files.
* text=auto eol=lf
# PowerShell helpers must keep CRLF (EOL discipline; the encoding rule is
# "pure ASCII or UTF-8 BOM" — see AGENTS.md). ★ 本文件只钉**入库形态**;工作区形态由
# `python tools/check_naming.py` 的规则 E 逐文件守(库里恒 LF,add 时归一)。
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
# Windows batch files must keep CRLF too (same reason as .ps1).
*.bat text eol=crlf
